{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03738","headline":"和杜学士旅次淮口阻风 · 李峤","name":"和杜学士旅次淮口阻风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夕吹生寒浦，清淮上暝潮。\n迎风欲举櫂，触浪反停桡。\n淼漫烟波阔，参差林岸遥。\n日沈丹气敛，天敞白云销。\n水雁衔芦叶，沙鸥隐荻苗。\n客行殊未已，川路几迢迢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}